## Three-layer capability closure

### 1. Invisible Unicode

Implemented with exact code-point/position findings, conservative safe removal, explicit review states for language/emoji-sensitive controls, post-clean rescan and receipts.

### 2. File metadata and provenance

Implemented for DOCX/PNG/JPEG sanitation with reinspection before billing commit. PDF/WebP remain explicitly inspection-only in the public workbench. C2PA/Content Credentials are verified/identified and destructive mutation is blocked when provenance may be cryptographically bound.

